flowchart TD
  G[Wallet.createRandom] --> E{KMS configured?}
  E -- yes --> K[Encrypt with AWS KMS]
  E -- no --> L[Encrypt with AES-256-GCM]
  K --> V[Vault entry at wallet/userId/uuid]
  L --> V
  V --> R[Only key path saved in MongoDB]
  R --> S[Sign request]
  S --> X[Decrypt briefly, sign, clear cache]
